title: uncluttered backlinks, edges as programs, and the privacy telescope
pid: 3aa33bf6-f06f-43a6-98bd-b88fb4bf45fb
body: |2-
  Maybe filter backlinks to include nothing in a more-private source.
  Maybe use two kinds of links: one- and two-sided.
    The target ignores one-sided links from its backlinks view.
    To convert to this, all links start bi, and the user can demote some --
    probably from the backlinks view.
